{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541","id":459961472,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NTk5NjE0NzI=","number":43541,"title":"Null pointer exception in /_scripts/painless/_execute endpoint using score context if no document match","user":{"login":"pnmougel","id":1636291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzYyOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1636291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel","html_url":"https://github.com/pnmougel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pnmougel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":23173,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzE3Mw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/%3Ebug","name":">bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null},{"id":146834791,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDY4MzQ3OTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/:Core/Infra/Scripting","name":":Core/Infra/Scripting","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"Scripting abstractions, Painless, and Mustache"},{"id":1967495446,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk1NDQ2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Core/Infra","name":"Team:Core/Infra","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for core/infra team"},{"id":2554900039,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTU0OTAwMDM5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/needs:reproduction","name":"needs:reproduction","color":"006b75","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-06-24T15:36:10Z","updated_at":"2024-05-29T22:30:03Z","closed_at":"2024-05-29T22:30:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Elasticsearch version** \r\n\r\n7.0.1\r\n\r\n**Plugins installed**: []\r\n\r\n**JVM version** \r\n\r\n9\r\n\r\n**OS version**\r\n\r\nLinux 4.18.0-22\r\n\r\n**Description of the problem including expected versus actual behavior**:\r\n\r\nThe endpoint `/_scripts/painless/_execute` throws a null pointer exception when the context parameter is set to `score` and the document in the context does not match the query.\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce**:\r\n\r\nSet up a simple mapping\r\n\r\n```\r\ncurl -X PUT \"localhost:9200/test\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'\r\n{\r\n    \"mappings\" : {\r\n        \"properties\" : {\r\n            \"field\": {\"type\": \"keyword\"}\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThe following call return a valid result\r\n\r\n```\r\ncurl -X POST \"localhost:9200/_scripts/painless/_execute\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"script\": {\r\n    \"source\": \"_score\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"context_setup\": {\r\n    \"index\": \"test\",\r\n    \"document\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"test\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"query\": {\r\n        \"term\": {\r\n            \"field\": \"test\"\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"context\": \"score\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIf the query is modified and does not match the document a null_pointer_exception is sent.\r\n```\r\ncurl -X POST \"localhost:9200/_scripts/painless/_execute\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"script\": {\r\n    \"source\": \"_score\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"context_setup\": {\r\n    \"index\": \"test\",\r\n    \"document\": {\r\n      \"field\": \"test\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"query\": {\r\n        \"term\": {\r\n            \"field\": \"no_match\"\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"context\": \"score\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Possible bugfix**\r\n\r\nIn `PainlessExecuteAction.java` file, in the method `innerShardOperation` the call `weight.scorer(indexSearcher.getIndexReader().leaves().get(0))` can return a null value but is not checked.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"rjernst","id":289412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTQxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289412?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst","html_url":"https://github.com/rjernst","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjernst/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/43541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,